[node name="Body" type="Label" parent="UI/HelpPanel/Margin/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 12
text = "WASD - Walk
E / LMB - Interact / Pick Up Power Cell
F / RMB - Raise Polaroid Camera
SPACE / Q - Snap Anchor Photo
T / G - Toggle Flashlight
C / TAB - Inspect Held Photo
H / F1 - Toggle Manual

QUANTUM SHIFT RULES:
1. When you leave a sector, unobserved doorways shift dynamically.
2. Photographing a doorway locks its spatial coordinates.
3. Complete all 3 tickets to unlock the 06:00 AM extraction elevator."

